From eb44c1d8ac8a66adc18b6ecfa4be19355ddfcf78 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shuzhen Wang <shuzhenwang@google.com>
Date: Fri, 12 Jun 2026 16:40:42 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 6/8] Camera: Fix heap OOB read/write in camera mappers

Change loop conditions in camera mappers (ZoomRatioMapper,
DistortionMapper, RotateAndCropMapper, and correctMeteringRegions)
to use `j + 5 <= entry.count` instead of `j < entry.count`.
This prevents heap out-of-bounds read and write when a
CaptureRequest contains a metering region with element count
that is not a multiple of 5.

Bug: 514726373
Test: cameraservice_test_host
Flag: EXEMPT BUGFIX
TAG=agy
CONV=e33154fc-dbf8-4f7d-ae71-88376924887a

